{"id": "spring-core/src/main/java/org/springframework/core/codec/DataBufferDecoder.java::30::1", "file": "spring-core/src/main/java/org/springframework/core/codec/DataBufferDecoder.java", "module": "spring-core", "block_start": 30, "start": 33, "end": 40, "indent": "", "lines": ["<p><strong>Note:</strong> The data buffers should be released via", "{@link org.springframework.core.io.buffer.DataBufferUtils#release(DataBuffer)}", "after they have been consumed. In addition, if using {@code Flux} or", "{@code Mono} operators such as flatMap, reduce, and others that prefetch,", "cache, and skip or filter out data items internally, please add", "{@code doOnDiscard(PooledDataBuffer.class, DataBufferUtils::release)} to the", "composition chain to ensure cached data buffers are released prior to an", "error or cancellation signal."]}
